    # ok pylammpsmpi 0.3.3 requires executorlib, which is not installed.
    # ok pyiron-atomistics 0.8.1 has requirement atomistics==0.3.0, but you have atomistics 0.3.1.
    # ok pyiron-atomistics 0.8.1 has requirement mp-api<=0.45.11,>=0.37.0, but you have mp-api 0.45.12.
    # ok pyiron-atomistics 0.8.1 has requirement structuretoolkit==0.0.35, but you have structuretoolkit 0.0.37.
    # ok mendeleev 1.1.0 has requirement pyfiglet<0.9,>=0.8.post1, but you have pyfiglet 1.0.4.
    # ok httpcore 1.0.9 has requirement h11>=0.16, but you have h11 0.14.0. - in JupyterLab is httpcore-1.0.9 - in pymatgen is h11 - fixed in pymatgen
